1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 33]</font>

15
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:19,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Jifu Inn]</font>

16
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The messenger sent
to the Imperial Palace</font>

17
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has been gone for a whole day.</font>

18
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are we just going to wait here?</font>

19
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xizhao hasn't even sent
an escort to receive us.</font>

20
00:01:28,440 --> 00:01:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How utterly discourteous.</font>

21
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I'd known this,</font>

22
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'd turn back to Beiyuan right now.</font>

23
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

24
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't always be so rash.</font>

25
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On our way here,</font>

26
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we saw it ourselves.</font>

27
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The outskirts of Xizhao are plagued.</font>

28
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps he's just busy.</font>

29
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could Mobai</font>

30
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have caught the plague?</font>

31
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That'd be even better.</font>

32
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you back to Beiyuan right now.</font>

33
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shut your mouth.</font>

34
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What madness is this, Jiang Yufan?</font>

35
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What luck today.</font>

36
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're awake.</font>

37
00:02:10,920 --> 00:02:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help!</font>

38
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Still resisting?</font>

39
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You scoundrel!</font>

40
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill you!</font>

41
00:02:19,600 --> 00:02:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

42
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

43
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

44
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, are you alright?</font>

45
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seize this scoundrel!</font>

46
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quickly!</font>

47
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

48
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you feeling?</font>

49
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

50
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

51
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

52
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

53
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it hurt?</font>

54
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

55
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the Prince will suffer for this.</font>

56
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop the sedan.</font>

57
00:02:59,280 --> 00:02:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

58
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've never seen anyone so frail.</font>

59
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fever never broke the whole journey.</font>

60
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've finally arrived.</font>

61
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it's happening again.</font>

62
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His condition...</font>

63
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It looks</font>

64
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

65
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison?</font>

66
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is that possible?</font>

67
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who could it be the one</font>

68
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who poisoned him?</font>

69
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

70
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

71
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure your wound is fine?</font>

72
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's because of the poison.</font>

73
00:03:49,640 --> 00:03:50,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang.</font>

74
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've brought back the scoundrel.</font>

75
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should we do with him?</font>

76
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill him.</font>

77
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief!</font>

78
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mustn't.</font>

79
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're not in Beiyuan.</font>

80
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we touch a man of Xizhao,</font>

81
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid</font>

82
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it will delay Ying's marriage.</font>

83
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Send him to the yamen of Tianzhao City.</font>

84
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let them handle their own.</font>

85
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember this:</font>

86
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This scoundrel resisted fiercely</font>

87
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and disturbed the Princess,</font>

88
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I crippled his hands and feet.</font>

89
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

90
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Moon Deity's Hall]</font>

91
00:04:27,760 --> 00:04:30,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome back, My Lady.</font>

92
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is he?</font>

93
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's been sent to your room.</font>

94
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, I'm really fine.</font>

95
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, wipe your face.</font>

96
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if your wound is fine,</font>

97
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're still burning with fever.</font>

98
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If we hadn't found you,</font>

99
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you would have died on the road.</font>

100
00:05:22,640 --> 00:05:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lost the Prince.</font>

101
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Until I find him,</font>

102
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't have peace of mind.</font>

103
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

104
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">didn't you set out before us?</font>

105
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you still here?</font>

106
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't even ask.</font>

107
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now, just focus on healing.</font>

108
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once your wounds are healed,</font>

109
00:05:41,960 --> 00:05:43,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll help you search for Li Congyao.</font>

110
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan is right this time.</font>

111
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should stay with us.</font>

112
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

113
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">does seeing me now</font>

114
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still make you uneasy?</font>

115
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, my brother's not uneasy.</font>

116
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's too ashamed to face you.</font>

117
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You talk too much.</font>

118
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's the truth.</font>

119
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wouldn't it be a burden?</font>

120
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Not at all.</font>

121
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Between us,</font>

122
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's never trouble.</font>

123
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True.</font>

124
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Between us,</font>

125
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">such words are unnecessary.</font>

126
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deity abhors killing.</font>

127
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came here alone,</font>

128
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a truly loyal and brave man.</font>

129
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you will reveal the location</font>

130
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of your Beiyuan military camp,</font>

131
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:08,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will order them</font>

132
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to release you</font>

133
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so you can return to your family.</font>

134
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This fallen state of yours</font>

135
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">suits you far better</font>

136
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">than your earlier arrogance.</font>

137
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ever since that day,</font>

138
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that arrow</font>

139
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has haunted my dreams every night.</font>

140
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">General.</font>

141
00:07:58,360 --> 00:08:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why won't you just let me go?</font>

142
00:08:02,960 --> 00:08:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

143
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei?</font>

144
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is she the woman by your side?</font>

145
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This reunion</font>

146
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is fate calling us together.</font>

147
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">General.</font>

148
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:23,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can only belong to me.</font>

149
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

150
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone from Xizhao's palace
just came.</font>

151
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said I'll be taken
to the Prince's Residence tomorrow.</font>

152
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, are you having regrets?</font>

153
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Regrets? Not really.</font>

154
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just trying to understand.</font>

155
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was it the Great Emperor's order
for your brother to marry me,</font>

156
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or is this what he truly wants?</font>

157
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though the situation has changed,</font>

158
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must believe</font>

159
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my brother's feelings for you
are genuine.</font>

160
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe everything you say.</font>

161
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan has gone missing.</font>

162
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be terribly worried.</font>

163
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will find him.</font>

164
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan says</font>

165
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you usually seem so carefree,</font>

166
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but once you set your mind on something,</font>

167
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one can stop you.</font>

168
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was the same with Changle,</font>

169
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the same when searching for Mobai,</font>

170
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the same with Li Congyao.</font>

171
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Jiang Yufan is not so fortunate.</font>

172
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is not among your obsessions.</font>

173
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, young ladies.</font>

174
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What keeps you chatting so long?</font>

175
00:09:39,760 --> 00:09:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you not hungry at all?</font>

176
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chengtian Sect]</font>

177
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

178
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji.</font>

179
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the steward
of the Prince's Residence.</font>

180
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome, Princess Minghua.</font>

181
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Envoy Jiang.</font>

182
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The largest residence
north of Tianzhao City</font>

183
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is our Prince's Residence.</font>

184
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's bestowed by the Great Emperor.</font>

185
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Fourth Prince has quite the airs,</font>

186
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sending only a steward to receive us.</font>

187
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince is in a meeting.</font>

188
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He truly couldn't get away.</font>

189
00:11:01,440 --> 00:11:02,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take it easy.</font>

190
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

191
00:11:05,040 --> 00:11:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, Xizhao</font>

192
00:11:06,680 --> 00:11:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is truly different from Beiyuan.</font>

193
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once we're settled in,</font>

194
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you out to explore.</font>

195
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, that's exactly what I want.</font>

196
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A perfect chance to stroll and shop.</font>

197
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does this have anything to do with you?</font>

198
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was speaking to Qinglan.</font>

199
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You, a bride-to-be,</font>

200
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just stay quietly in your quarters.</font>

201
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun, he won't play with me.</font>

202
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you looking at?</font>

203
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't they the people
from the Chengtian Sect</font>

204
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we saw back in Jifu Village?</font>

205
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

206
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go with you.</font>

207
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go where? Stay put.</font>

208
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay with the carriage.</font>

209
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

210
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

211
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

212
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I saw the Prince.</font>

213
00:11:57,640 --> 00:11:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao?</font>

214
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where did he go?</font>

215
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

216
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:02,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

217
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if I have to turn
Tianzhao City upside down,</font>

218
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will find him for you.</font>

219
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

220
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two had a long journey.</font>

221
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be tired.</font>

222
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:15,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guest rooms have been prepared.</font>

223
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The wedding is tomorrow.</font>

224
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please rest early.</font>

225
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is your Fourth Prince?</font>

226
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess, you may not know.</font>

227
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">According to our Xizhao customs,</font>

228
00:12:23,960 --> 00:12:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before the wedding ceremony,</font>

229
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the couple cannot meet.</font>

230
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, it brings bad luck.</font>

231
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So many excuses.</font>

232
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you, sir.</font>

233
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin,</font>

234
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Highness awaits you in the study.</font>

235
00:12:37,800 --> 00:12:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wishes to catch up with you.</font>

236
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants to see Qinglan?</font>

237
00:12:42,880 --> 00:12:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about my sister?</font>

238
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

239
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's fine.</font>

240
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

241
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin.</font>

242
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please.</font>

243
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you. Look.</font>

244
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the classic intimidation.</font>

245
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you're married into this family,</font>

246
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">imagine how much you'll have to endure.</font>

247
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

248
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't I help you run away from this?</font>

249
00:13:08,640 --> 00:13:10,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A man like this isn't worth marrying.</font>

250
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you saying?</font>

251
00:13:12,520 --> 00:13:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I run away,</font>

252
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you and Father would lose your heads.</font>

253
00:13:15,680 --> 00:13:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

254
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Mobai's consort now.</font>

255
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must act
with the bearing of a consort.</font>

256
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you know?</font>

257
00:13:36,640 --> 00:13:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The blood thread guides the way:</font>

258
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Northward orientation.</font>

259
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

260
00:13:41,160 --> 00:13:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems the one who poisoned you</font>

261
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is at the Prince's Residence
north of the city.</font>

262
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the Fourth Prince was just recovered
by the Great Emperor.</font>

263
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's at the height of his favor.</font>

264
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must not act rashly.</font>

265
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait until we find the poisoner first.</font>

266
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:54,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady,</font>

267
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Grandlord sent me to tell you</font>

268
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to attend the Fourth Prince's wedding</font>

269
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tomorrow.</font>

270
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What perfect timing.</font>

271
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

272
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling, would you care to join me?</font>

273
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

274
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

275
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

276
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No hugging.</font>

277
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are a prince now.</font>

278
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't let others see and gossip.</font>

279
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:38,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the Prince's Residence.</font>

280
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are my little sister.</font>

281
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll hold whoever I please.</font>

282
00:14:41,680 --> 00:14:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see who dares to gossip.</font>

283
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

284
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You look so troubled.</font>

285
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I lost Li Congyao.</font>

286
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could a grown man
like him just get lost?</font>

287
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were at the border</font>

288
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and came across a village struck
by the red eye disease.</font>

289
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the chaos,</font>

290
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:01,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he just vanished into thin air.</font>

291
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

292
00:15:03,960 --> 00:15:04,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll send men to help you find him.</font>

293
00:15:19,760 --> 00:15:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

294
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

295
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

296
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally here.</font>

297
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your wedding is tomorrow,</font>

298
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I came to see you.</font>

299
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

300
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">did you see Mobai?</font>

301
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is he doing well?</font>

302
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is being a prince very tiring?</font>

303
00:15:36,280 --> 00:15:37,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does he look worn out?</font>

304
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did he...</font>

305
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did he miss me?</font>

306
00:15:41,440 --> 00:15:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did he ask about me?</font>

307
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was too busy.</font>

308
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After I told him about Li Congyao,</font>

309
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the steward came to find him.</font>

310
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't get a chance to ask.</font>

311
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

312
00:15:52,280 --> 00:15:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Never mind, let's not dwell on that.</font>

313
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me show you my treasures.</font>

314
00:15:58,680 --> 00:15:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at this.</font>

315
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a Jade Ruyi</font>

316
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from the Great Emperor of Xizhao.</font>

317
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The dragon and phoenix carved on it</font>

318
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">symbolize the future emperor
and empress.</font>

319
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems</font>

320
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:12,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Great Emperor is quite fond of me.</font>

321
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our Ying is so adorable.</font>

322
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who wouldn't adore you?</font>

323
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

324
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've made up my mind.</font>

325
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether your brother
is still angry with me or not,</font>

326
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will strive to be a good wife to him.</font>

327
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,
what I carry on my shoulders</font>

328
00:16:28,760 --> 00:16:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is peace between Beiyuan and Xizhao.</font>

329
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This burden</font>

330
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a little heavy,</font>

331
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but who asked me to be</font>

332
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so exceptionally talented and beautiful?</font>

333
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

334
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You will surely be
the most beautiful bride.</font>

335
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

336
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations!</font>

337
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An alliance of two nations by marriage.</font>

338
00:17:02,120 --> 00:17:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A covenant sealed in one hall.</font>

339
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An auspicious union eternally bound.</font>

340
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A match in hearts as one.</font>

341
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First bow, for amity
between the two allied nations.</font>

342
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Second bow,
to heaven and earth</font>

343
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for blessings upon the mortal realm.</font>

344
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Third bow, to each other,</font>

345
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:31,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so they'll be united
in heart and virtue.</font>

346
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The ceremony is complete.</font>

347
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Excellent!
- Wonderful!</font>

348
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for being late.</font>

349
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, greetings.</font>

350
00:17:56,000 --> 00:17:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

351
00:17:59,090 --> 00:18:00,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

352
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:03,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

353
00:18:03,630 --> 00:18:06,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

354
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:11,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

355
00:18:12,230 --> 00:18:15,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

356
